WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.427
Multiply the numbers as whole numbers then place the decimal point according to the

00:00:05.427 --> 00:00:06.920
number of decimal places.

00:00:07.783 --> 00:00:14.055
Calculate 4.8 times 8. The answer is 38.4. 4.8 times 8 equals 38.4.

00:00:14.867 --> 00:00:20.338
A ribbon for a school fundraiser is 6.8 metres long. How many metres are in 7 equal

00:00:20.338 --> 00:00:22.269
ribbons? Pause the video and think.

00:00:23.117 --> 00:00:30.424
A ribbon for a school fundraiser is 6.8 metres long. How many metres are in 7 equal

00:00:30.424 --> 00:00:34.722
ribbons? The answer is 47.6. 6.8 times 7 equals 47.6.
